go-hsql
=======

This is an independent, clean implementation of a Go database/sql driver for
HSQLDB (HyperSQL). It contains no HSQLDB source code.

The HSQLDB network wire protocol implemented here was studied from the HyperSQL
project's source, which is distributed under a BSD 3-Clause license:

    Copyright (c) 2001-2025, The HSQL Development Group
    All rights reserved.
    https://hsqldb.org/

Protocol constants, message layouts, and type codes are functional facts of the
wire format. No HyperSQL source is copied into or distributed with this driver.

For development and testing, a local copy of the HyperSQL source and a compiled
server jar may be placed under `.hsqldb/`; that directory is git-ignored and is
not part of this project's distribution.
